WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.767
Welcome to Module 8 of the
Non-Person Identity learning path:

2
00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:08.525
convert Kerberos accounts to group and
delegated managed service accounts.

3
00:00:08.525 --> 00:00:11.557
This module is the
on-premises part of Gate 5,

4
00:00:11.557 --> 00:00:15.262
Conversion, with Chapter 6
of the developer workbook.

5
00:00:15.262 --> 00:00:19.671
You'll read each Kerberos
account's reviewed disposition,

6
00:00:19.671 --> 00:00:24.080
the owner's decision from Module
3, plan its move to a G M S A or,

7
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.927
on a Windows Server
2025 domain, a D M S A,

8
00:00:26.927 --> 00:00:32.622
list what stays on the Kerberos island with
an end date and, where it has S P N's,

9
00:00:32.622 --> 00:00:38.500
an S P N owner, and reconcile every managed
account with the program's end state.

10
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.400
Then you'll see the write path run
a plan only by its approved hash.

11
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:47.280
The domain is fictional, and the
apply changes only a fake, in memory.
